# Bucks Files cluster — shared connection settings.
# Copy to cluster-config.env and fill in. NEVER commit the real file.
#
# CLUSTER_SECRET must be identical on every machine. Generate one with:
#   od -vN 32 -An -tx1 /dev/urandom | tr -d ' \n'
# BOOTSTRAP is filled in automatically when you run setup-host.sh on the host.
# TS_AUTHKEY: optional. Paste a reusable Tailscale auth key here and peers will
# join your tailnet headlessly (no browser login). Generate one at:
#   https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys  (toggle "Reusable")
# Leave blank to fall back to interactive browser login.
CLUSTER_SECRET=""
BOOTSTRAP=""
TS_AUTHKEY=""
